  "title": "Registration events polled on every 60s interval regardless of current tab",
  "description": "R6 deep audit finding. Dimension: business_logic. Severity: P1. Source SHA: bbd487a3. Scope: R6_DEEP_AUDIT_WAVE. In the 60-second polling interval, refreshRegEvents is always called (line ~1866: `r.refreshRegEvents?.()`) regardless of which tab the user is on. This means registration events are fetched every 60 seconds even when the user is on the Events, Analytics, or any other tab. While this is intentional (to update the sidebar badge count), it creates unnecessary API load. Other tab-specific data is only fetched when the user is on that tab.",
